<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="te">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>తెలుగు అనిమే వరల్డ్ - ఉచిత డబ్బింగ్</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+Telugu:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
      font-family: 'Noto Sans Telugu', sans-serif; 
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #0f0c29); 
      color: #fff; 
      min-height: 100vh; 
      padding: 20px;
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255,107,107,0.3);
    }
    h1 { 
      font-size: 2.8rem; 
      color: #ff6b6b; 
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff6b6b;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .subtitle { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #a29bfe; }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .anime-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
    .anime-card {
      background: rgba(48, 43, 99, 0.8);
      border-radius: 18px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid #ff6b6b33;
    }
    .anime-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-12px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(255,107,107,0.4);
    }
    .anime-img {
      height: 180px;
      background: #555;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .play-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%; left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      background: #ff6b6b;
      width: 60px; height: 60px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .anime-card:hover .play-btn { opacity: 1; }
    .anime-info {
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .anime-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #ff6b6b;
    }
    .anime-ep { 
      color: #a29bfe; 
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ff6b6b;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 8px 4px 0;
      transition: 0.3s;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .btn:hover { 
      background: #ff5252; 
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .btn-tg { background: #2aabee; }
    .btn-tg:hover { background: #1c92d2; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-top: 50px;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .warning {
      background: rgba(255,107,107,0.15);
      border: 1px solid #ff6b6b;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #ffcccc;
    }
    @media *(max-width: 768px)* {
      h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
      .anime-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>తెలుగు అనిమే వరల్డ్</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">తెలుగులో డబ్ చేసిన అత్యుత్తమ అనిమే సిరీస్ & మూవీస్</p>
